# Diagnostic / probe output captures.
# The scripts in scripts/dev/ write their stdout to .txt files in the repo
# root (see each script's header). Those are regenerable investigation
# artifacts, not source — keep them out of git.
*_probe*.txt
*_output*.txt
*_diagnosis.txt
*_debug.txt
scrape_cs2*.txt
hltv_*.txt
team_matches*.txt

